1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:06,030
Chips ₹99, T-shirt ₹499, earphones ₹999.

2
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:07,640
Kabhi round price kyun nahi?

3
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:10,490
Yeh 1 rupaya aapke dimaag se khel raha hai.

4
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:14,970
Ek second mein batao: ₹500 aur ₹499, kaunsa sasta laga?

5
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:17,340
Dimaag ne turant 499 bola na?

6
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:18,970
Kyunki hum left se padhte hain.

7
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:22,740
Pehla number 4 dikha, aur dimaag ne maan liya "400 ke aas paas".

8
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:24,720
Farak sirf 1 rupaye ka hai.

9
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:30,030
America ke ek experiment mein toh 39 dollar wali dress, 34 wali se bhi zyada biki.

10
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:32,940
Kyunki 9 pe khatam price "deal" jaisa lagta hai.

11
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:36,260
Dukaandaar 1 rupaya chhodta hai, aap zyada kharidte ho.

12
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:39,160
Aise "kyun" ke liye Whysplained ko subscribe karo.

13
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:42,960
Ye free hai, 99 paise bhi nahi lagenge!
